cff-version: 1.2.0
title: flybrain
message: >-
  This is an independent hobby project, not a peer-reviewed study. If you cite
  anything from it, cite the connectome releases and the published models it
  replicates -- listed in the README -- rather than this repository.
type: software
authors:
  # The repository owner set the goals, made the methodological calls and
  # caught the framing errors; the model produced the code, experiments,
  # measurements and literature review. See the Provenance section of the
  # README, which states plainly who is answerable for the assessments.
  - alias: annel0
  - name: Claude Opus 5 (Anthropic)
abstract: >-
  A fast GPU simulator for connectome-constrained spiking models of the
  Drosophila central nervous system, together with an honest record of what it
  could and could not establish.
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/annel0/flybrain
keywords:
  - connectomics
  - Drosophila
  - spiking neural network
  - Triton
  - reproducibility
